{"id":7426,"date":"2021-04-05T15:32:54","date_gmt":"2021-04-05T19:32:54","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=7426"},"modified":"2021-04-05T17:52:43","modified_gmt":"2021-04-05T21:52:43","slug":"our-first-harvest-hosts-overnighter","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/04\/05\/our-first-harvest-hosts-overnighter\/","title":{"rendered":"Our First Harvest Hosts Overnighter"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>We left friends and family in My Gilead about 9:00 this morning and slowly meandered our way down U.S. Route 42.\u00a0 We deliberately took the U.S. Route instead of the interstate.\u00a0 After all, we&#8217;re retired and not in any hurry, right?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/GileadToMorowMap.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"531\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/GileadToMorowMap.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7427\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/GileadToMorowMap.jpg 531w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/GileadToMorowMap-295x300.jpg 295w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 531px) 100vw, 531px\" \/><\/a><figcaption>Our first travel day in a year!<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>We stopped at the T\/A Truck stop near London to fill our diesel since we have a discount card that saves us a good chunk in the Big Truck lanes at T\/A, Loves, Pilot, Petro, and a few others.\u00a0 Besides, in the truck lanes the nozzle is at least twice the diameter of those in the car lanes and we can fill this 94 gallon tank in a jiffy.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>With our TSD Logistics card we save sometimes as much as 60 vents a gallon.\u00a0 Today the pump price was $3.17 and we paid $2.70 &#8230; That&#8217;s a good price for diesel &#8212; we saw other stations on the way down that were as high as $3.35\/gallon for diesel.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"alignright size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/TSD-London-OH-Receipt.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/TSD-London-OH-Receipt.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7429\" width=\"363\" height=\"419\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/TSD-London-OH-Receipt.jpg 370w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/TSD-London-OH-Receipt-260x300.jpg 260w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 363px) 100vw, 363px\" \/><\/a><figcaption>Our net price was $2.77 \/ gallon<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"alignleft size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_145645576.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_145645576.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7428\" width=\"310\" height=\"413\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_145645576.jpg 405w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_145645576-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 310px) 100vw, 310px\" \/><\/a><figcaption>Receipt shows pump price of $3.199 \/ gallon<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you drive a diesel motorhome or pull a trailer with a diesel truck, you can find out more about TSD Logistics and their RV diesel savings program by <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2020\/05\/01\/saving-on-diesel-fuel-new-program\/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"7093\">reading my earlier post covering the subject<\/a>.  We&#8217;ve saved hundreds over the last couple of years.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>After fueling up we stopped and grabbed a late breakfast at Bob Evans, then rolled on down the road to Valley Vineyards at Morrow, Ohio just north of Cincinnati.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>I had left a phone message for them before we left this morning and owner Rodney called me back when he opened shop and welcomed us to come on down.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We&#8217;ve got a nice spot parked alongside a green grassy field and a small stream.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143530636.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143530636.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7432\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143530636.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7432\" class=\"wp-image-7432\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143530636.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143530636-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143530636-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_144257394_HDR.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_144257394_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7430\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_144257394_HDR.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7430\" class=\"wp-image-7430\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_144257394_HDR.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_144257394_HDR-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_144257394_HDR-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143554279.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143554279.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7431\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143554279.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7431\" class=\"wp-image-7431\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143554279.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143554279-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143554279-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-caption\">Our spot for the night at Valley Vineyards @ Morrow, OH<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Rodney retired from General Electric a few years ago, then got a call to manage worldwide operations for PayPal.&nbsp; He did that until a little over a year ago when he bought the winery.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Rodney tells me he knows a lot about wine from the bottle to the lips, but admits he knows very little about what it takes to get it in the bottle, so he&#8217;s fortunate to have hired talented staff to help him with that end of the business!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>They have indoor seating along with a large patio, a large buffet on weekends as well as LIVE music.  The kitchen has a pretty varied menu, and of course LOTS of wine.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_170507556_HDR.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_170507556_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7434\" class=\"wp-image-7434\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_170507556_HDR.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_170507556_HDR-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_170507556_HDR-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_170457396.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_170457396.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7435\" class=\"wp-image-7435\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_170457396.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_170457396-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_170457396-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_170434494.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_170434494.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7436\" class=\"wp-image-7436\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_170434494.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_170434494-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_170434494-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_164540343_HDR.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_164540343_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7437\" class=\"wp-image-7437\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_164540343_HDR.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_164540343_HDR-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_164540343_HDR-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">My Chicken Bacon Siracha Wrap<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_164545690_HDR.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_164545690_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7438\" class=\"wp-image-7438\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_164545690_HDR.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_164545690_HDR-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_164545690_HDR-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Kathy&#8217;s Blanco Pizza<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_163734690.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_163734690.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7439\" class=\"wp-image-7439\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_163734690.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_163734690-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_163734690-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_163720641_HDR.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_163720641_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7440\" class=\"wp-image-7440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_163720641_HDR.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_163720641_HDR-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_163720641_HDR-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Kathy&#8217;s Flight<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_163539437_HDR.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_163539437_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7441\" class=\"wp-image-7441\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_163539437_HDR.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_163539437_HDR-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_163539437_HDR-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Owner Rodney<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143358659.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143358659.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7442\" class=\"wp-image-7442\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143358659.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143358659-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210405_143358659-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-caption\">Click on any of the thumbnail photos above to open a larger view<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/harvesthosts.com\/\" target=\"_blank\">Harvest Hosts<\/a> offer their farm, museum, distillery, brewery, or golf course to HH members to park for the night, learn about their operation and their way of life, and of course take advantage of whatever the host might have for sale.  Although there is no charge to stay at a <a href=\"https:\/\/harvesthosts.com\/\">Harvest Hosts<\/a> operation, it&#8217;s certainly appreciated by the host if we eat, drink, or otherwise help in the commerce of the operation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you&#8217;re an RV&#8217;er, we recommend Harvest Hosts property owners as providing a wonderful alternative to the typical campground or RV park.  You might give it a try!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Thanks for riding along, and once again if you&#8217;d like to follow along with all our travel posts, just sign up with your email address to receive regular updates.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>By the way, we&#8217;re on our way to Burkesville, Kentucky for 3 months to volunteer as Camp Hosts at Dale Hollow Lake State Park &#8211; then after July 4th we&#8217;ll be changing directions!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Take Care, stay safe, and be good to those you care about <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Herb &amp; Kathy<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We left friends and family in My Gilead about 9:00 this morning and slowly meandered our way down U.S. Route 42.\u00a0 We deliberately took the U.S. Route instead of the interstate.\u00a0 After all, we&#8217;re retired and not in any hurry, right? We stopped at the T\/A Truck stop near London to fill our diesel since &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/04\/05\/our-first-harvest-hosts-overnighter\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Our First Harvest Hosts Overnighter<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,586,554707329,554707760],"tags":[6523779,554707555,554707230,554707945,554707943,554707944,814,554707845],"class_list":["post-7426","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-food","category-traveling","category-volunteering","tag-boondocking","tag-dry-camping","tag-food","tag-harvest-hosts","tag-morrow","tag-valley-vineyards","tag-wine","tag-winery"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7426","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=7426"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7426\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":7444,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7426\/revisions\/7444"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=7426"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=7426"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=7426"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}